---
import { COMPANY_URL, TOOLBOX_URL } from '../consts';

const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<div class="shell footer-grid">
		<div class="footer-statement">
			<p class="footer-kicker">FROM OKINAWA, WITH PRACTICE.</p>
			<p>うまくいった話も、失敗した話も。<br />小さな会社の現場で試したことを残します。</p>
		</div>
		<div class="footer-links">
			<div>
				<strong>このサイト</strong>
				<a href="/blog">記事を読む</a>
				<a href="/about">玉城について</a>
				<a href="/privacy">プライバシー</a>
				<a href="/affiliate-disclosure">広告・紹介について</a>
			</div>
			<div>
				<strong>外部リンク</strong>
				<a href={TOOLBOX_URL}>玉城祐輔の道具箱 →</a>
				<a href={COMPANY_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">T&Lサポート株式会社 ↗</a>
				<a href="https://www.facebook.com/yusuke.tamashiro" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook ↗</a>
				<a href="https://www.instagram.com/tamashiro_yusuke_tl/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class="shell footer-bottom">
		<span>&copy; {today.getFullYear()} Yusuke Tamashiro</span>
		<span>AIは魔法ではなく、仕事を楽にする大工道具。</span>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	footer {
		margin-top: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
		padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) 0 2rem;
		background: var(--ink);
		color: var(--paper);
	}

	.footer-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: 4rem;
	}

	.footer-kicker {
		color: var(--coral);
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
	}

	.footer-statement p:last-child {
		max-width: 570px;
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.5vw, 3.1rem);
		line-height: 1.45;
	}

	.footer-links {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.footer-links div {
		display: flex;
		align-items: flex-start;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.65rem;
	}

	.footer-links strong {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
		color: #aaa999;
		font-size: 0.7rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
	}

	.footer-links a {
		color: var(--paper);
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.footer-links a:hover {
		color: var(--coral);
	}

	.footer-bottom {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-top: 5rem;
		padding-top: 1.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
		color: #aaa999;
		font-size: 0.72rem;
	}

	@media (max-width: 760px) {
		.footer-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}

		.footer-bottom {
			align-items: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
		}
	}
</style>
